mooncake_delight.book.pack=Mooncake Delight
mooncake_delight.book.ingredients=Ingredients
item.mooncake_delight.sesame=Sesame
mooncake_delight.book.flour.description=You can get 2~6 by crushing wheat on the cutting board with an anvil
mooncake_delight.book.lotus_seed.description=Has a chance to be obtained when breaking Lily Pads
mooncake_delight.book.truffle.description=Has a chance to be obtained when breaking Podzol
mooncake_delight.book.tallow.description=Tallow and Tallow Crumbs are dropped when Cows, Sheep, Goats, and Pigs are killed\nThe drop is unaffected by Looting and does not require a player kill; the animal must die while on fire, unless an Oiled Knife is used
mooncake_delight.book.sesame.description=Breaking Grass has a chance to drop White Sesame. White Sesame can be planted\nBreaking Sesame Crop also has a chance to drop Black Sesame
mooncake_delight.book.thanks.description=Special thanks to §o§hWither_Redstone§r for creating this wonderful mod, and it is a great honor to receive permission to port it.